{
  "file_id": "3551",
  "text_count": 149,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������The fake sign's ready! Heeheehee!",
      "_offset": 2160,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Soon the Chosen Child will appear,\nsee the sign, and fall right into\nmy trap!",
      "_offset": 2202,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I have to do something, or else\nLord Vamdemon will...",
      "_offset": 2280,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Koushirou, can we rest for a bit?\nI'm dead tired.",
      "_offset": 2334,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "We have to find Gennai as soon as\npossible!",
      "_offset": 2384,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "But it's already been two months.",
      "_offset": 2428,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "I'll keep going, no matter how\nmany months it takes.",
      "_offset": 2462,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Koushirou! Wait for meeeeeee!",
      "_offset": 2515,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "If we meet Gennai, we can learn\nthe secret behind the Crests!",
      "_offset": 2545,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "You know, Koushirou, the fact that\nyou're always curious is what I \nlike about you.",
      "_offset": 2607,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Stop, I'm getting embarrassed.\nAnyway, where's Gennai?",
      "_offset": 2691,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "But we didn't even take a break!\nKoushirou!",
      "_offset": 2746,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Ah! It's a sign.",
      "_offset": 2790,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "\"Beware of Falling Poop Ahead\"...",
      "_offset": 2807,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "What's this?",
      "_offset": 2841,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Huh? If it says that, then we\nshould take a detour.",
      "_offset": 2854,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Heeheeheehee!",
      "_offset": 2906,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "This area really is full of poop.",
      "_offset": 2920,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I wanna get through this mountain\nas quickly as we can!",
      "_offset": 2954,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "But these signs are a huge help.",
      "_offset": 3010,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Ah! Another sign!",
      "_offset": 3043,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Seems like this time we should go\nthis way instead.",
      "_offset": 3061,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Ah! Uwaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 3113,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "W-Waaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 3130,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I did it, I did it! A great\nsuccess!!",
      "_offset": 3146,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 3184,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 3197,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Can't you fly, Tentomon?",
      "_offset": 3210,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "I can't fly! Tryin' to fly just\nmakes me fall right back down!",
      "_offset": 3235,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "How far are we going to keep\nfalling?",
      "_offset": 3298,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "To Hell.",
      "_offset": 3336,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Hell? Don't mess with us!",
      "_offset": 3345,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "No! I don't wanna go to Hell!",
      "_offset": 3371,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Those who are possessed by greed\nwill fall into Hell.",
      "_offset": 3401,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "I don't believe we're possessed by\nany type of greed, but...",
      "_offset": 3455,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "No, you are possessed, by the\ngreed of wanting to know\neverything.",
      "_offset": 3516,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "No way!",
      "_offset": 3583,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Do you want to fall into Hell?!",
      "_offset": 3591,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "I don't want to faaaaaaaaaaall!",
      "_offset": 3623,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "I don't, either!",
      "_offset": 3655,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Then throw away your inquisitive\nheart!",
      "_offset": 3672,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "But Koushirou, that's what I like\nabout you...",
      "_offset": 3712,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "But at this rate we're both going\nto fall into Hell!",
      "_offset": 3759,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 3812,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "How do I throw it away?",
      "_offset": 3825,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Pray for it!",
      "_offset": 3849,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "I don't want to know! I don't want\nto know!",
      "_offset": 3862,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Where in tarnation are we?!",
      "_offset": 3906,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "The Sacred Mysterious Universe.",
      "_offset": 3934,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "A-aaaaaaaaah.",
      "_offset": 3966,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Who are you?",
      "_offset": 3980,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "I am Vadermon, the ruler of the\nSacred Mysterious Universe.",
      "_offset": 3993,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Vadermon...",
      "_offset": 4053,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I will dispose of the inquisitive\nheart that you've discarded.",
      "_offset": 4065,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Koushirou...",
      "_offset": 4128,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "It is much more important to\nacquire Cosmic Power.",
      "_offset": 4141,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "...much more important to acquire\nCosmic Power...",
      "_offset": 4192,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Just like that. Heeheehee...",
      "_offset": 4242,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "The fundamentals of Cosmic Power\nlie in your breathing.",
      "_offset": 4271,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Koushirou, don't get sucked into\nthat hogwash!",
      "_offset": 4327,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "The correct way to breathe is to\ngenerate alpha rays from your\nright chest...",
      "_offset": 4374,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Stop it!",
      "_offset": 4452,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Continue your training!",
      "_offset": 4461,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Yes. A...B...C...D...",
      "_offset": 4485,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Huh? Did I dig the pit that deep?",
      "_offset": 4507,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "I still haven't gotten the Crest.\nWhat do I do...?",
      "_offset": 4541,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Hm, hmmmmm! I've obtained a good\nheart today.",
      "_offset": 4592,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Excuse me, have you seen a human\nand a Digimon fall into this hole\nanytime recently?",
      "_offset": 4641,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "I saw them, I saw them! Please\nwait a moment!",
      "_offset": 4726,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Sorry to keep you waiting! Here's\nthat kid's inquisitive heart!",
      "_offset": 4772,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "...his heart?",
      "_offset": 4836,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "I'm the Merchant of the Heart\nUniverse. Haven't you come to buy\na heart?",
      "_offset": 4850,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "No, I want the Tag and Crest that\nkid was holding!",
      "_offset": 4923,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Good sir, this is a heart shop! I\ndon't sell that kind of thing!",
      "_offset": 4974,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "But I've got a fine poop for you.",
      "_offset": 5039,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "A poop?! That's respectable!",
      "_offset": 5073,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "I'd like to trade with you, you\nknow!",
      "_offset": 5102,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "I'll do it! I'll do it!!",
      "_offset": 5140,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "E...F...G...",
      "_offset": 5165,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Koushirou...",
      "_offset": 5178,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "H...I...J...K...L...M...",
      "_offset": 5191,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "There's something I'd like to tell\nyou.",
      "_offset": 5216,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "What's it *this* time?!",
      "_offset": 5256,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "To use Cosmic Power, you must\nthrow everything away.",
      "_offset": 5280,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Everything?",
      "_offset": 5333,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Hand over all of your personal\nbelongings.",
      "_offset": 5345,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Yes. I don't need this.",
      "_offset": 5388,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Aaaaah! You can't do that!",
      "_offset": 5412,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Stay quiet!",
      "_offset": 5439,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Aaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 5451,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Heeheehee! Now, the Crest!",
      "_offset": 5461,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Koushirou! Get yourself together!",
      "_offset": 5488,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Tento...mon...",
      "_offset": 5522,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Koushirou!",
      "_offset": 5537,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Tentomon...what was I...",
      "_offset": 5548,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Tch! You're back to normal!",
      "_offset": 5573,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Koushirou, you're right back to\nnormal! Huh? Power's flowin'\nthrough me!",
      "_offset": 5601,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "You think you can defeat me?",
      "_offset": 5674,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Gaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 5703,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Kabuterimon!",
      "_offset": 5713,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "This is bad! I ain't got enough\npower yet!",
      "_offset": 5726,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "If I could get back my inquisitive\nheart...",
      "_offset": 5769,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "The inquisitive heart is mine!",
      "_offset": 5813,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "My curiosity is an important part\nof me. I want to know. I want to\nknow!",
      "_offset": 5844,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Aaaaaaah! You stole the\ninquisitive heart!",
      "_offset": 5917,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Kabuterimon, get up! We'll\ncontinue our adventure together!",
      "_offset": 5960,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Koushirou! What's going on? I'm\ngettin' a ton of energy!",
      "_offset": 6020,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "You evolved with the power of the\nCrest, AtlurKabuterimon!",
      "_offset": 6077,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "What is this? But just bluffing\nyour way through won't defeat me!",
      "_offset": 6136,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "We did it, Koushirou!",
      "_offset": 6202,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "AtlurKabuterimon!",
      "_offset": 6224,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Is that the exit?",
      "_offset": 6242,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Let's get outta here!",
      "_offset": 6260,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 6282,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "He's taking so long. What's that\nVadermon guy doing?",
      "_offset": 6288,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
